<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRANCE 2 ITALY 2 -- RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE 2 ITALY 2 -- RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France and Italy drew 2-2 in their Tournoi de France match at the Parc des Princes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France: Zinedine Zidane 12, Youri Djorkaeff 72</p>
<p>Italy: Pierluigi Casiraghi 61, Alessandro Del Piero 90 (penalty).</p>
